{
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "MLP-250",
      "en": "My partner and I have been trying to get pregnant for over a year without success. Does this mean we are considered infertile?",
      "zh": "我和伴侣尝试怀孕超过一年但没有成功。这是否意味着我们被认定为不孕？",
      "evidence_id": "S000"
    },
    {
      "id": "MLP-5218",
      "en": "I was told my blood has too few platelets, which is called thrombocytopenia. What kind of health risk does this put me at?",
      "zh": "医生告诉我我的血小板数量太少，这叫血小板减少症。这会给我带来什么样的健康风险？",
      "evidence_id": "S006"
    },
    {
      "id": "MLP-258",
      "en": "I recently took a course of antibiotics and now have a skin infection. Could the medication have made me more likely to get a fungal infection?",
      "zh": "我最近服用了一疗程的抗生素，现在皮肤感染了。药物会让我更容易患上真菌感染吗？",
      "evidence_id": "S007"
    },
    {
      "id": "MLP-6427",
      "en": "I have been diagnosed with optic neuritis. Can you tell me what causes inflammation of the optic nerve?",
      "zh": "我被诊断出患有视神经炎。你能告诉我是什么导致视神经发炎的吗？",
      "evidence_id": "S007"
    },
    {
      "id": "MLP-6053",
      "en": "I have a sore in my mouth with a gray center and red edge. Is there anything I should avoid eating to help it heal?",
      "zh": "我嘴里有一个中间发灰、边缘发红的溃疡。为了帮助它愈合，我应该避免吃些什么食物？",
      "evidence_id": "S008"
    }
  ]
}
